{"t": 1794109576.9820852, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found and fixed in code.\n\nCause: CloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api` (eu-west-1) shows `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, immediately after `INFO upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. The CSV writer in reports/export.py only declared `id,amount`, so every export raised and the API returned 502.\n\nFix: added `currency` as a third CSV column (order: id,amount,currency) in reports/export.py. Rows without it export blank; verified locally with multi-row and legacy-row cases.\n\nStatus: code fix ready, needs reports-api redeploy/restart to clear the 502. No other services affected."}, "ok": true}
